{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16807","headline":"重阳宴集同用寒字 · 张登","name":"重阳宴集同用寒字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锡宴逢佳节，穷荒亦共欢。\n恩深百日泽，雨借九秋寒。\n望气人谣洽，临风客以难。\n座移山色在，杯尽菊香残。\n欲识投醪遍，应从落帽看。\n还宵须命烛，举首谢三官。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}